.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SS "template<uint32_t dim>
.br
class csmp::NodeManifold< dim >": a class that contains pointers to topologically (and most often also physically) collocated nodes\&. SplitBoundaries (node-matching standalone mesh patches connected by interface elements typically consist of \fBNodeManifold\fP objects\&. 


.PP
\fBAttention\fP
.RS 4
the nodes on the perimeter of a \fBSplitBoundary\fP that terminates in a volume are not duplicated! - therefore they are not manifolds\&. 
.RE
.PP

