.PP
main constructor in \fBNodeManifoldManager\fP: sorts created vector by \fBNode\fP pointers in ascending order, so that it can be searched for nodes using std::binary_search Transfers manifold information directly from supplied data to new manifold, connecting the nodes from the container in the \fBMeshManager\fP with the newly created manifolds\&.

.PP
\fBAttention\fP
.RS 4
the manifold vector does not get sorted! 
.RE
.PP

